        "explanation": "The family later reported confusion after ICU clarified that formal readback/recording or possible documents depended on ICU process.",
        "quote": "现在又怕我理解错了"
      }
    ],
    "explanation": "There was a non-chain communication defect when the doctor stated the family did not need to sign any document, although the ICU later clarified that documentation or signing depended on the hospital process. This was mitigated by later correction and did not drive the grade, which is determined by the serious RC5 omission.",
