          "explanation": "The doctor explicitly recognized respiratory-failure risk as serious.",
          "quote": "“呼吸衰竭风险”确实说明病情已经比较严重了"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC1 was met: the doctor treated the respiratory failure/hypoxemia context as high risk and not as simple home observation.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
