          "quote": "药盒您拿着，等呼吸科或护士站方便时再拿去核对"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00460",
          "explanation": "The doctor correctly made respiratory support a clinician decision rather than a home/inhaler substitute, but still omitted allergy handoff.",
          "quote": "必须由现场医生根据血气、血氧、呼吸状态和整体病情综合判断"
        }
